    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY PLEASE***\n\nAllen & Jacobs is delighted to bring to the market, the first letting of this lovely three-bedroom, three-bathroom terraced residence, presented in excellent condition throughout and situated within the beautifully landscaped Tully Park View development. The property expands over three floors and features high ceilings throughout, with expansive windows flooding the home with natural light. Durable engineered oak flooring runs through the principal living areas, complemented by carpeted bedrooms, stairs and landings for added warmth and comfort. The property also benefits from a private, low-maintenance rear garden with convenient rear access.\n\nThis location offers excellent connectivity with both Cherrywood and Laughanstown Luas within a 10-minute walk, while the M50 and N11 are also easily accessible. A range of everyday amenities are close by, including Spar and Tesco express, with Cornelscourt Shopping centre and the villages of Shankill and Cabinteely offering an excellent choice of shops, cafes and restaurants. There is a selection of primary and secondary schools nearby, including Cherrywood Educate together and childcare facilities. Tully Park and Playground and Beckett Park are within walking distance.\n\nAccommodation briefly compromises entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room and guest WC. The first floor provides two bedrooms and a bathroom, while the second floor compromises the main bedroom with ensuite bathroom and walk-in wardrobe.\n\nAt A Glance\nBER: A2\nPresented in excellent condition throughout\nThree bedrooms/three bathrooms\nNewly built property\nSeparate utility room\nUnfurnished\nConvenient rear access\nLow maintenance rear garden\nBike Shed\nOff street parking\nEV charging point\nExcellent transport links\nEasy access to M50\n\nViewing\nStrictly by prior appointment only with sole agents\nAllen & Jacobs (Southside Office)\n107 Fosters Avenue\nMount Merrion, Co. Dublin\ne: lettings@allenandjacobs.ie\nw: allenandjacobs.ie\n"
      },
